# 15-inch T1 MacBook Pro (13,3 / 14,3): devices allowed into D3cold do not come back after suspend
# (Radeon SMU reload fails; Thunderbolt xHCI "device inaccessible"). Forbid D3cold for all PCI devices
# and keep PCI bridges powered. Also covers the NVMe, which Omarchy's NVMe fix misses on these models.
# After nohzafk/omarchy-macbookpro-t1 PR #5 (strawberry-code).
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="pci", ATTR{d3cold_allowed}="0"
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="pci", ATTR{class}=="0x0604*", ATTR{power/control}="on"
